pp_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214702800", "author": {"steamid": "76561198409126652", "personaname": "GonnaLooseIt", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/717012/", "num_games_owned": 80, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1010, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1010, "last_played": 1766980100, "avatar": "2b9463799b846780047dfd4c1b8a7f3006e20c5e"}, "language": "english", "review": "For the base price of $17.99, the game is fairly solid all things considered. There are plenty of features that have a lot of room to make more interesting gameplay loops. My biggest issue with the gameplay is the simple fact the gun play is not tactical or interesting. Grinding also feels worse since reaching later into the game, as I have grown used to doing the same route over and over to get my gear.\n\nOutside of the game itself, developer behavior seems rather... unsavory to say the least. With the recent debacle of handling community content and misuse of steam's announcement features, I do not have a valid reason to support the developers.\n\nOverall, Solid game with a fair price, with a few key flaws that keep me from recommending it to others. Developer behavior also makes me hesitant on recommending this game.", "timestamp_created": 1767151694, "timestamp_updated": 1767151694, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.579257845878601074", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214700421", "author": {"steamid": "76561199237124839", "personaname": "Lemon Maple Syrup", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199237124839/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2096, "playtime_last_two_weeks